# oracle: fix nvt/manifold/rattle on a sphere whose radius is an equal-style variable ramped from 10 to 9.9 (v_R, read before every step), Nose-Hoover chain of 4 (tchain), temp 1.0 to 1.2, 500 LJ particles of examples/PACKAGES/manifold/energy/sphere.data; the timestep is set before the fix (the fix keeps its constructor timestep, as native)
# Native reference: LAMMPS b332f28 built with PKG_MANIFOLD (/store/shuvam/software/lammps-build-manifold/lmp; the installed binary has no MANIFOLD)
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 2.8e-14, atoms 3.8e-13.
# oracle-examples: PACKAGES/manifold/energy/sphere.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all
units           lj
boundary        f f f
read_data       sphere.data
pair_style      lj/smooth/linear 2.5
pair_coeff      * * 1.0 1.0
pair_modify     shift yes
timestep        0.001
variable        R equal ramp(10.0,9.9)
velocity        all create 0.8 87287 dist gaussian
fix             step all nvt/manifold/rattle 1e-8 20 sphere v_R temp 1.0 1.2 0.1 tchain 4
thermo_style    custom step temp pe ke etotal v_R
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          25
run             300
